  "implementation": {
    "lifecycle": "Common automatic jobs and assessment deadline schedulers capture DISABLE_JOBS at module initialization; only exact lowercase true skips automatic initial pass and periodic registration; existing 5s/10s intervals and manual request behavior remain.",
    "metadata": "Platform GET /admin/jobs adds allowlisted schedulerStatus after the SQL read; ordinary organization response omits the snapshot. Existing final identity, organization, role, account-mode, CSRF, audit.read and org.platform guards remain after all reads.",
    "scope": "The status describes the responding API instance only. Lifecycle and in-flight busy state remain independent; stopped does not cancel/drain. observedAt is separate from database serverTime. UI is read-only with no polling or worker controls.",
    "persistence": "No schema migration or new dependency."
  },
